{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-visual-browser#card-zh","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-visual-browser","commit":"68670688f7a3c80940c169d126a10f7bb7943c6b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual-browser 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的可视化浏览器插件，在右侧栏显示由本机 Chrome 打开的实时页面。它通过 browser_open、browser_see 和 browser_act 等工具，让 Agent 查看编号后的交互元素并执行点击、输入、滚动等操作；用户也能在面板中观看、接管页面、管理标签并查看页面控制台。插件按工作区隔离浏览器会话，并保存访问历史。使用需要本机安装 Chrome、Edge 或 Chromium，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-75","lib/tools.js:160-220","client.js:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-visual-browser#card-en","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-visual-browser","commit":"68670688f7a3c80940c169d126a10f7bb7943c6b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-visual-browser adds a live Chrome panel to the DSH sidebar. Agent tools open pages, inspect numbered elements, and click, type, or scroll; users can watch, take over, manage tabs, and view the console. Sessions are scoped by workspace. Requires local Chrome, Edge, or Chromium; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-75","lib/tools.js:160-220","client.js:1-20"]}
