{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-visual-browser#feature-1-agent-browser","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-visual-browser","commit":"68670688f7a3c80940c169d126a10f7bb7943c6b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual-browser 的功能「agent-browser」：Agent 可通过浏览器工具打开网址、查看编号后的交互元素并执行网页操作；查看和操作结果会以精简文本及可选页面截图返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:160-220"]}
