{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-visual-browser#feature-3-workspace-history","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-visual-browser","commit":"68670688f7a3c80940c169d126a10f7bb7943c6b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual-browser 的功能「workspace-history」：浏览器标签、跟随状态和访问历史按 DSH 工作区隔离；访问历史会保存到本机文件，供地址栏建议使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:29-51","lib/history.js:1-30"]}
